DATA PROVENANCE

All instances in this benchmark are SYNTHETIC and procedurally generated from
recorded seeds. The rock mass quality fields, fault geometry, topography,
portal locations and production-zone geometry were constructed to be
geotechnically representative of a hard-rock underground operation, using the
published NGI Barton Q-system support classes. They are NOT derived from,
measured at, or descriptive of any real or operating mine, and the coordinate
frame is a neutral local origin with no geographic meaning.
